{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>Train.CDSL</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"neural_nets_lib","href":"../../../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Ocannl","href":"../../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Train","href":"../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"CDSL","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"<p>Precisions and debug toggles, for configuring a session from code.</p>","content":"<div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-half\"><a href=\"#val-half\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> half : <a href=\"../../../../arrayjit/Ir/Ops/index.html#type-prec\">Ir.Ops.prec</a></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-single\"><a href=\"#val-single\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> single : <a href=\"../../../../arrayjit/Ir/Ops/index.html#type-prec\">Ir.Ops.prec</a></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-double\"><a href=\"#val-double\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> double : <a href=\"../../../../arrayjit/Ir/Ops/index.html#type-prec\">Ir.Ops.prec</a></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-virtualize_settings\"><a href=\"#val-virtualize_settings\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> virtualize_settings : <a href=\"../../../../arrayjit/Ir/Low_level/index.html#type-virtualize_settings\">Ir.Low_level.virtualize_settings</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>The process-wide virtualization settings (<a href=\"../../../../arrayjit/Ir/Low_level/index.html#type-virtualize_settings\"><code>Ir.Low_level.virtualize_settings</code></a>).</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-enable_all_debugs\"><a href=\"#val-enable_all_debugs\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> enable_all_debugs : <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?debug_logs</span>:bool <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?hosted_only</span>:bool <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span>unit <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> unit</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Raises the log level to at least 2 and turns on the build-directory debug files; with <code>hosted_only</code> (default <code>true</code>) disables device-only virtualization, and with <code>debug_logs</code> (default <code>false</code>) turns on logging from routines.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-disable_all_debugs\"><a href=\"#val-disable_all_debugs\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> disable_all_debugs : <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?restore_defaults</span>:bool <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span>unit <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> unit</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Undoes <a href=\"#val-enable_all_debugs\"><code>enable_all_debugs</code></a>; <code>restore_defaults</code> (default <code>false</code>) also re-enables device-only virtualization.</p></div></div>"}